{"generated": "2026-10-22 18:34", "curation": {"market": "개인 투자자를 위한 최근 24시간 시장 뉴스 핵심 테마 브리핑입니다.\n\n<b>1. 미 증시 AI주 강세와 나스닥 상승</b>\n뉴욕증시는 스페이스X의 호실적 발표와 빅테크 기업들의 AI 투심 회복에 힘입어 나스닥 지수가 1.05%~1.1% 상승하는 등 3대 지수가 일제히 오름세를 보였습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE00V2NPOFpFLVlIeHRtMkRad2o0cmtiVEtJWFVCZU1DVmFkXy02YWZRUkU5b0d5WDlYeUx5QlhyQklMZUxlZmJWdXlsamJremRZNlBBZXlGcFZMbTVYTVNJWFJrWDlPYTZNcmhrSGlNOA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#27</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5ERTBqZ2Fram1rNnd0a21SMzZ6MmY1YlRHVGV0dzVEamg5SGZMNTZZakdrSGppWDA5eVRfLVJuMFpXcEVra1JDR1d0bzRRR1g3emJ5bk5RWS1BRk16TFZoWENMM0ZXZUpnVVQ5ZQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#28</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE1xUW96ckpOTHhkYzJKZk81S3F1bzl6SEhPRHNjME9GTm1jWTFCNGs2VmE1d2VtTjdNazk1UkFDUWZYZFpsWXVRNk9ZZHZBbEtIdlU4RVF2djVHaU9oZG9ZaW1FSFBIc1AzNHc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#34</a>]. 테슬라 주가가 3% 상승하고 AI 서버 및 반도체 관련주가 강세를 나타내며 뉴욕 증시 전반의 상승을 이끌었습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBjd2JUTEw3OEFYRXVKWlJncW1TU0FFUkJveWstdmdlcVZWV2ZFYjlneWhiY094UDJSczNQdjhkMnppQmNFNVBzYU9xTnRrNlNGU000aVE3ZTVMeDhSWi1BZUdfVUdiWXRsNUwtcDBoR3Y?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9RWjluZ1hjNlVCbURpOW9uUVBwRDdXbjAyaXNPX1dBejc0Z1pKZm9wTnpfQzR5ZUFMQTNHaFVXNzFkQmFJQWRFYWxDdWNBUFpQdEpjTUZoc05BYUtXZVExSVJFRGhVZW9VdWl5dzluTDJQUHRDM1E?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a>].\n\n<b>2. 미 증시와 디커플링된 국내 증시 급락</b>\n미국 증시의 상승 호재에도 불구하고 코스피와 코스닥은 하루 만에 상승분을 반납하며 3% 넘게 급락했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE50SWZOUDVBOW9lclp0YV83NjhIRXBrZklxLUJXZUhRZ0Q0c2tsMm5tYWg0M19tRU1ONDMwZElQRVZ4NTZTVE0xZUgzY2pmY2lhMWJjdTVGQ3RjbVlsSFE?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#9</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE41U1ZVWU11bDNfSmltS2VaSXF1NmNud0RnTTduMmcyZ29ra1I0d0tjV3FHX0VDM0h